oying billows they almost touched;—at that instant, a red arm and a hammer hovered backwardly uplifted in the open air, in the act of nailing the flag faster and yet faster to the subsiding spar. A sky-hawk that tauntingly had followed the main-truck downwards from its","emotions":[["joy",0],["trust",0.01],["fear",0.8],["surprise",0.82],["sadness",0.68],["disgust",0.1],["anger",0.58],["anticipation",0.95]],"texture":[["pace",1],["tension",1],["interiority",0.13],["imagery",0.99],["ideas",0.31],["humor",0.37],["valence",0.01]],"mood":["grim",0.79],"mode":["action",1],"themes":[["death",0.96],["nature",0.81],["journey",0.47]]},"dna":[{"e":"surprise","v":0.65},{"e":"surprise","v":0.64},{"e":"surprise","v":0.59},{"e":"surprise","v":0.61},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.59},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.69},{"e":"surprise","v":0.65},{"e":"surprise","v":0.66},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.6},{"e":"fear","v":0.76},{"e":"trust","v":0.64},{"e":"trust","v":0.63},{"e":"surprise","v":0.69},{"e":"surprise","v":0.58},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.45},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.66},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.58},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.64},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.58},{"e":"surprise","v":0.67},{"e":"surprise","v":0.59},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.58},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.65},{"e":"surprise","v":0.49},{"e":"surprise","v":0.37},{"e":"surprise","v":0.42},{"e":"fear","v":0.55},{"e":"surprise","v":0.47},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.74},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.77},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.72},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.78},{"e":"surprise","v":0.72},{"e":"fear","v":0.75},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.66},{"e":"surprise","v":0.64},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.61},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.68},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.74},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.73},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.71},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.54},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.59},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.72},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.79},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.6},{"e":"surprise","v":0.58},{"e":"surprise","v":0.68},{"e":"anticipation","v":0.59},{"